ypes. Any SwiftLog ","type":"text"},{"code":"LogHandler","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" can be supplied by the factory.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Each call replaces both settings. Omitting the factory restores YubiKit’s backend;","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"omitting the level uses the selected handler’s level. Changes apply to existing sessions,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"though logs already in progress may use the previous settings.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"YubiKit’s configuration does not affect other libraries. To share your app’s backend,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"pass its factory explicitly; global ","type":"text"},{"code":"LoggingSystem.bootstrap","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" does not select YubiKit’s backend.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Factories may run concurrently and must not log through YubiKit themselves.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Traffic-logging","text":"Traffic logging","type":"heading","level":3},{"type":"codeListing","code":["YubiKit.Logs.configure(logLevel: .trace)"],"syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Raw traffic and SCP plaintext logs require ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"YubiKit to be compiled with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DEBUG"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Neither configuration nor a custom backend can enable them in other builds.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Custom connections are responsible for their own traffic logging.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"name":"Warning","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Debug logs can include account names and credential identifiers."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Trace logs can include PINs, credentials, and cryptographic keys. Protect or redact logs before sharing them."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside","style":"warning"},{"anchor":"Custom-backends","text":"Custom backends","type":"heading","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Labels identify categories, such as ","type":"text"},{"code":"com.yubico.YubiKit.OATH","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"code":"com.yubico.YubiKit.FIDO","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Metadata carries details such as byte counts and error codes; the default backend displays","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"these as ","type":"text"},{"code":"key=value","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" pairs. Message wording and metadata keys are not a stable API.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Your backend controls formatting, storage, and export. YubiKit does not retain log messages.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit"]]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/yubikit\/loggingguide"]}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Article","role":"article","modules":[{"name":"YubiKit"}],"title":"Logging"},"references":{"doc://yubikit-swift.YubiKit/documentation/YubiKit/Logs":{"url":"\/documentation\/yubikit\/logs","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Configures logging for YubiKit connections and sessions.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"Logs","identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/Logs","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Logs","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Logs","kind":"identifier"}]},"documentation-header.png":{"identifier":"documentation-header.png","type":"image","variants":[{"traits":["2x","light"],"url":"\/images\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation-header@2x.png"},{"traits":["2x","dark"],"url":"\/images\/yubikit-swift.YubiK